<title>USA: Comcast Corp unit sells $1.7 bln in debt.</title>
<headline>Comcast Corp unit sells $1.7 bln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Comcast Corp unit, Comcast Cable Communications Inc was priced on Thursday in the private placement market, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The deal was increased to $1.7 billion, from an initial size of $1.0 billion to meet investor demand, sources said.</p>
